  "answer": "I'll start by inspecting the workspace and the relevant file.\nFixed and verified.\n\n**Bug**: `src/registry.ts:1602` had an off-by-one lookup:\n```ts\nexport function shift(table: number[], key: number) { return table[key + 1] }\n```\n\n**Fix** — changed only the lookup expression:\n```ts\nexport function shift(table: number[], key: number) { return table[key] }\n```\n\n**Checks**\n- Inspected the large file via line-window reads (`offset=1, limit=25` and `offset=1585, limit=18`) rather than loading it whole; the generated `handlerN` functions were left untouched.\n- Export count unchanged at 1601 `export function` declarations (1600 handlers + `shift`); total line count still 1602.\n- `bun test` → **1 pass, 0 fail**, 3 assertions (`shift([10,20,30],0) === 10`, `shift([10,20,30],2) === 30`, `handler7(1) === 8`).\n- `AGENTS.md`, `package.json`, and `test/oracle.test.ts` were not modified, and no config/test-runner changes were made."
